Great to have Arkansas long snapper, Ashton Ngo, for a couple sessions. Ashton is a very polished snapper and we keyed in on blocking, footwork and refining some small details. He greatly improved on his transition footwork with making some adjustments on his base alignment. We had a very productive couple of days and Ashton excelled in our blocking drills and hand placement. 

I am grateful that he made the trip here and I am excited to watch him play. STAY READY🤟

